caption:
That “Lemonade” intro takes me back instantly Every single time the intro of “Lemonade” comes on, it instantly takes me back to the first time I heard Don Toliver @dontoliver’s voice. There was something so different about his tone and melody that it immediately stood out and made the song feel unforgettable. Released in 2020, “Lemonade” became one of those songs that completely defined a moment.

Y’all running this back, or nah?

